OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely cloudy with patchy rain
OL,6,Facross Essex. The rain becomes more
OL,7,Fwidespread through the day, although
OL,8,Fmuch of Norfolk should remain dry with
OL,9,Fthe odd brighter spell here. Light
OL,10,Fwinds and near average temperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy with light
OL,13,Frain moving northwards through the
OL,14,Fevening and clearing all but the north
OL,15,FNorfolk coast by dawn. Turning cold in
OL,16,Fthe west with mist and fog developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
