OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy and damp start with
OL,6,Fmist, fog and patchy light rain
OL,7,Fdeveloping across the east. Becoming
OL,8,Fdrier with the brighter spells in the
OL,9,Fwest. Feeling cool with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure remains dominant. Mostly
OL,13,Fcloudy with the odd spot of rain on
OL,14,FSunday, but becoming drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter for Monday and Tuesday. Light
OL,16,Fwinds and temperatures around normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
